    "A freehand mask needs at least three points. Tap around the subject to draw one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine Freihandmaske braucht mindestens drei Punkte. Tippe rund um das Motiv, um eine zu zeichnen."
